#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In order to successfully use &cirkuit;, you need &kde; 4 and a working LaTeX "
"distribution. The individual backends might have additional requirements. "
"Here is a (partial) list of the default backends' requirements:"
msgstr ""
"Da biste uspješo koristili &cirkuit; trebate &kde; 4 i radnu verziju LaTeX-"
"a. Pojedine podloge mogu da imaju dodatne zahtjeve. Ovdje se nalazi "
"(djelimična) lista osnovnih zahtjeva za podloge:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use the Circuit Macros backend, a PIC interpreter must be installed. At "
"the moment, two interpreters are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Da bi se koristila Cirkuit Macros podloga, PIC prevodilac mora biti "
